Assuming aboot is in the correct location, but there is no correct 
aboot.cfg file

boot dka0 file vmlinuz.gz

Then,  edit boot/aboot.cfg to reflect your environment.

After that, the SRM command:

boot dka0

should work.

Use the SRM command "show config" If you're in doubt about SCSI device names.

